<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Learn how NovBank approaches account security, transaction controls and financial activity protection.">
  <title>Security | NovBank</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public-pages.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/security-premium.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="nb-security-page">
    <%- include('../partials/public-nav') %>
    <main>
      <section class="nb-security-hero">
        <div class="nb-security-hero-inner">
          <span class="nb-security-eyebrow"><i></i> NOVBANK SECURITY</span>
          <h1>Protection should be part of the experience, not an afterthought.</h1>
          <p>NovBank is designed around layered account protection, controlled money movement and clear activity visibility—so important financial actions are easier to understand and control.</p>
          <div class="nb-security-actions">
            <a class="nb-security-btn nb-security-btn-primary" href="/register">Open an account <span>→</span></a>
            <a class="nb-security-btn nb-security-btn-ghost" href="#controls">See our controls <span>↓</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nb-security-panel" aria-label="Security status preview">
          <div class="nb-security-panel-top"><span>SECURITY CENTER</span><b>● ACTIVE</b></div>
          <div class="nb-security-score"><small>ACCOUNT PROTECTION</small><strong>Layered</strong><span>Multiple controls work together around your account.</span></div>
          <div class="nb-security-status"><div><span>Account access</span><b>Protected</b></div><div><span>Transaction review</span><b>Controlled</b></div><div><span>Activity visibility</span><b>Available</b></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="nb-security-intro" id="controls">
        <div><span class="nb-security-label">THE SECURITY MODEL</span><h2>One layer is never the whole story.</h2><p>Financial security is strongest when access, authentication, transaction controls and account visibility reinforce one another. NovBank is structured around that principle.</p></div>
        <div class="nb-security-index"><strong>04</strong><span>Core protection areas<br>working together</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="nb-security-grid">
        <article class="nb-security-card nb-security-card-dark"><span>01</span><div class="nb-security-icon">⌁</div><h3>Secure account access</h3><p>Authentication and session controls are designed to keep account access deliberate and protected.</p><b>Access controls</b></article>
        <article class="nb-security-card"><span>02</span><div class="nb-security-icon">✓</div><h3>Transaction controls</h3><p>Important money movement can move through clear review and approval states instead of disappearing into the background.</p><b>Money movement</b></article>
        <article class="nb-security-card nb-security-card-blue"><span>03</span><div class="nb-security-icon">◌</div><h3>Activity visibility</h3><p>Account activity is kept visible so customers can understand what happened, what is pending and what is complete.</p><b>Clear status</b></article>
        <article class="nb-security-card"><span>04</span><div class="nb-security-icon">▣</div><h3>Auditable operations</h3><p>The platform is built to keep important operational events and financial actions traceable as the system grows.</p><b>Traceable activity</b></article>
      </section>

      <section class="nb-security-command">
        <div><span class="nb-security-label">BUILT FOR CONFIDENCE</span><h2>Security should also feel understandable.</h2><p>Strong protection should not force customers to guess what a button did or whether a transaction succeeded.</p></div>
        <div class="nb-security-principles"><div><strong>01</strong><span>Know what is happening</span><small>Clear statuses for important financial actions.</small></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Know what you can control</span><small>Account and transaction controls stay close to the customer.</small></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>Know what happened</span><small>Activity and records make financial events easier to review.</small></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="nb-security-feature">
        <div class="nb-security-feature-visual"><div class="nb-lock-ring"><span>✓</span></div><div class="nb-lock-line"></div><div class="nb-lock-chip">ACCOUNT PROTECTED</div></div>
        <div><span class="nb-security-label">A SECURITY-FIRST FOUNDATION</span><h2>Designed to grow with stronger controls.</h2><p>As NovBank expands, the security model can support additional authentication methods, monitoring, alerts, limits and operational safeguards without changing the core experience.</p><a href="/products">Explore the product platform <b>→</b></a></div>
      </section>

      <section class="nb-security-bottom"><div><span class="nb-security-label">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span><h2>Take control of your banking experience.</h2><p>Open an account and experience a financial platform designed with protection and clarity at its foundation.</p></div><a class="nb-security-btn nb-security-btn-primary" href="/register">Open an account <span>→</span></a></section>
    </main>
    <%- include('../partials/public-footer') %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>